+# Activities
+
+Activities are the account's timeline of what happened to cards and comments, such as cards being added, assigned, moved, or commented on. They are the same events shown in the web app's timeline, except for deprecated collection moves, and they include card title changes.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a list of activities on boards the current user can access, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by ID(s) of the users who created the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+Repeated values within a parameter are ORed together. The two parameters combine with AND. Boards you can't access never appear in the results, even when requested with `board_ids[]`.
+
+__Event kinds:__
+
+| Action | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_published` | A card was added |
+| `card_assigned` | Cards were assigned to users |
+| `card_unassigned` | Users were unassigned from a card |
+| `card_board_changed` | A card was moved to another board |
+| `card_title_changed` | A card was renamed |
+| `card_triaged` | A card was moved to a column |
+| `card_sent_back_to_triage` | A card was moved back to "Maybe?" |
+| `card_closed` | A card was moved to "Done" |
+| `card_reopened` | A card was reopened |
+| `card_postponed` | A card was moved to "Not Now" |
+| `card_auto_postponed` | A card was moved to "Not Now" due to inactivity |
+| `comment_created` | A comment was posted on a card |
+
+__Event fields:__
+
+| Field | Description |
+|-------|-------------|
+| `id` | Event ID |
+| `action` | Event kind, as listed above |
+| `created_at` | When the event happened |
+| `description` | Plain-text description of the event, as seen by the current user. Like the plain-text form used in webhook payloads, names and titles are HTML-escaped, so quotes appear as `&quot;` and apostrophes as `&#39;` |
+| `particulars` | Event-specific details, described below |
+| `url` | For card events, the card. For comment events, the card the comment was posted on, anchored to that comment |
+| `eventable_type` | `Card` or `Comment` |
+| `eventable` | The card or comment, using the same representation as the cards and comments endpoints |
+| `board` | The board, using the same representation as the boards endpoints |
+| `creator` | The user who triggered the event, using the same representation as the users endpoints |
+
+__Particulars:__
+
+| Action | `particulars` |
+|--------|---------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+| All other actions | `{}` |
+
+Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+__Response:__
+
